{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_01",
  "title": "閒聊波爾卡",
  "storyCode": "LE-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6772158c6253ee0ab9a1bf5225bedff24dbe4bf81964253ded325c90bafc0211",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g5_czernyhome"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我在選拔賽上讓你們兩個出局了，但現在情況有變，你們是《晨暮》的第一候選了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情況有變是說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原定要演奏《晨暮》的那兩個人不能參加音樂會了，所以我才找你們過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能參加音樂會......他們出什麼事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那兩個人昨天下午跑到酒館大吃大喝去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來這倒也正常，可是，不知為了什麼雞毛蒜皮的小事，這兩個活寶竟然在酒館裡和人打了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果，吹長笛的胳膊骨折，拉大提琴的更厲害，居然摔斷了尾椎骨，坐都坐不下去，還趴在床上說自己可以站著拉琴，簡直胡鬧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好像很驚訝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這實在有些......出人意料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出人意料？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說實話，入選的第二天就出這種事，假如這不僅僅是一場偶然的打架鬥毆，你就是最大的嫌疑人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是最大的嫌疑人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不——不不不，這事和我毫無瓜葛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是更希望用音樂打動您，而不是對無辜之人拳打腳踢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說得倒挺好聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，既然你有錢資助白堊，花錢雇幾個人，對你而言應該也輕而易舉，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生，我也可以作證，黑鍵沒有做這種事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能作證？你昨天一直盯著他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你盯著他幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然不是“他盯著我”，而是我們倆在一起，商量如何讓您回心轉意啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然直到最後也沒商量出什麼結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊，他說的是真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（搖頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然這樣，那我姑且相信白堊一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝車爾尼先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別急著高興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說到底，你們是替補上來的，離我的要求還有不小的差距。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尤其是黑鍵，你是拖後腿的那個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我給你們一天時間練習，晚上再到我家來，我來驗收。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有達到我的最低標準，你們才算是入選了。要不然，我寧可把《晨暮》這首曲子撤掉，明白嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白，請您放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，白堊，你不是沒有大提琴嗎？這把琴你先拿回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我真的可以拿嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果今晚你們能達到我的要求，這把琴就是你的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——謝謝，謝謝您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，回去吧，我也要整理一下自己的思路——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是烏爾蘇拉嗎？你又忘記帶鑰匙了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "門外的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生，我是羅德島的幹員，您可以叫我芙蓉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是芙蓉！難道爺爺出了什麼狀況——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，車爾尼先生，初次見面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和他們已經聊完了，你要是有事就帶他們走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉，爺爺的病情有什麼變化嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，放心。你爺爺經過治療之後，情況已經比較穩定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生，其實我不是來找白堊，而是來找您的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望能瞭解一下您最近的病情變化，不知道您現在方不方便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "問我這個幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近夕照區出現了不少異常好轉的感染者，我來夕照區就是為了調查這一現象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外，您在夕照區家喻戶曉，說不定您對整體情況也有一些把握。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，我自己一直好得很，至於別人的病情，我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可您不是要開告別音樂會嗎？一般來說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，我需要一個安靜的環境，現在能請你離開了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又是哪位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "門外的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，開開門，我忘記帶鑰匙啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊，能不能麻煩你再去開個門？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老奶奶，您拎了好多東西啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好孩子，快去屋裡坐著，我自己就能拿得動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係的，我來幫您把東西送到廚房！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏爾蘇拉，我的遠房親戚。我一直受她照顧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家裡來了這麼多客人，這可不多見......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位怕不是貴族老爺？這可真是失禮了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不敢當。您要是願意，可以直接叫我黑鍵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您這樣的貴族，就別和老婆子開玩笑啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可不是玩笑，您叫我黑鍵就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就請您恕老婆子無禮啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏爾蘇拉婆婆，您好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，怎麼是薩卡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呸，呸！姑娘，我只是嘴快，沒別的意思，別往心裡去啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事的，烏爾蘇拉婆婆，我已經習慣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼說，還是得給你道個歉......真對不起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來找先生有什麼事啊？也是音樂會的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那倒不是。我來是想問一下，車爾尼先生的病情有沒有什麼變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是醫生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是羅德島的幹員，您可以叫我芙蓉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你和行板是同事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行板是本地幹員，我是從本艦來維謝海姆出差的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就放心啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生和我的藥都是行板配的，夕照區有不少人都從羅德島拿藥呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生這幾天......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，人家畢竟是醫生，醫生關心你的身體，這是好事呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我又沒請她來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就不對了，你不請她，她也進不來呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從去年開始，先生的身體就一直不怎麼好，一直到今年初春都是這樣，要不然，也不會想著辦什麼告別音樂會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是從昨天開始，先生看起來反而好了不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有其他情況嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我想想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏爾蘇拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好，我不說啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常感謝您的協助，烏爾蘇拉婆婆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果車爾尼先生有什麼情況，還請您告訴我一聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算沒有這句話，要是出了什麼事，我也得去拜託你們羅德島呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聊完了？高興了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聊完啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_489_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——呀，瞧我這記性，說著要做馬鈴薯湯，卻忘了買馬鈴薯......我再去一趟市場！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（幾乎冒出火來的眼神）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——烏爾蘇拉婆婆，我也和您一起去市場！我想向您請教一些烹飪上的問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，既然大家都走了，我們也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "車爾尼先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鑰匙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏爾蘇拉婆婆，鑰匙，您的鑰匙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼、呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真沒想到一個老太太也能走這麼快，我差點追不上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才多虧有你幫我打圓場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼，我相信你不會為了入選做那種事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在鑰匙也送過去了，我們也該在夕照區找個地方練習了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能像大家一樣，直接在街上演奏嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們是練習，又不是賣藝，街上太嘈雜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你家怎麼樣？正巧你爺爺也搬出去了，我每天從高庭區走過來也累得要死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能不能拜託你給我騰一張床，我這段時間就住你家裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我倒是很歡迎，可我家太破，我怕你住不習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會習慣的，會習慣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g6_whitehome"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡就是我家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（房間太小，窗戶漏風，木料發黴，隔音幾乎等於沒有......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼，挺好的，挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——等下，這裡只有一張單人床。你爺爺睡哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爺爺睡床，我打地鋪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可......這不就是一張地毯嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地毯也挺好的，我也已經睡習慣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你要在這住，我就接著打地鋪，沒問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是先練習吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，我在波音這裡卡住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，我們從上一行最後一個小節重新開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又是這個波音......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在這一段放慢一點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用，一個裝飾音而已。我就是有點猶豫了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——又是這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑鍵，我把速度放慢，別再糾結這個裝飾音了，用單音帶過去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "標記就寫在譜上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是為了給這個波音做準備，你連前面一段的氣息都不穩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，完整地合了一遍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可那個裝飾音我沒吹，車爾尼肯定聽得出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係的，我們還有時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "話是這麼說，可按照現在這個狀態，你已經用不著接著練了，只有我還得繼續花時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有，我其實也有處理不好的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看這裡，其實是有強弱對比的，我剛剛沒表現出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還真是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有一些地方我處理得也很勉強，要說熟悉還早呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可嚇了我一跳，我還以為你已經徹底練熟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，時間這麼短，想一次性練熟也不太可能，很多東西是要慢慢來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先休息一會兒吧，之後我們再去摳細節。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "越過高高的山崗，惡魔踏入黃昏的中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血中的惡疾隱伏，款款招來蔓延的死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蟲自陰暗中湧出，肆意噴吐毀滅的前奏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終曲的合奏消散，災禍帶走最後的陽光。"
